#!args --verify-dirty
# the app's own drags onto "Später" (#502, 549..729 x 285..375), which defers every drop's answer
# (ui.drop_defer) and gives it 100 ms later (ui.drop_finish): a drag inside the app waits for it
# too.  Its source reports DS_ACTIVE until the answer ("Quelle"), then DS_END with the effect
# drop_finish gave (drag_effect, UIC_DRAG_END; "Ende").  Before charge 11 drop_defer said false
# for the app's own drags and the source ended at the release with the effect of the drop.  The
# apple is taken (moved), the pear not, the cherry gets no answer (the library's after
# DROP_DEFER_MS, as the drop was delivered).
theme light
drag #101 640,330
expect text:"Abgelegt: Text+Frucht -> Später (verschieben, erlaubt: kopieren+verschieben)" exists
expect text:"Antwort: wartet" exists
expect text:"Quelle: Apfel" exists
expect text:"Ende: -" exists
expect text:"Ziehen: -  Über: -" exists
expect text:"Erlaubt: kopieren+verschieben" exists
drop expect pending
wait 150
expect text:"Antwort: genommen (verschieben)" exists
expect text:"Ende: Apfel verschieben (1)" exists
expect text:"Quelle: -" exists
expect text:"Erlaubt: -" exists
drop expect move
# not taken: the drag ends without an effect
drag #102 640,330
expect text:"Antwort: wartet" exists
expect text:"Quelle: Birne" exists
wait 150
expect text:"Antwort: nicht genommen" exists
expect text:"Ende: Birne keine (2)" exists
drop expect none
# no answer: after DROP_DEFER_MS the library answers as the drop was delivered (a UIWARN)
expect_nowarn
drag #103 640,330
wait 150
expect text:"Antwort: keine Antwort" exists
expect text:"Quelle: Kirsche" exists
expect text:"Ende: Birne keine (2)" exists
drop expect pending
wait 2900
expect text:"Ende: Kirsche verschieben (3)" exists
expect text:"Quelle: -" exists
drop expect move
expect_warn
# a drop that is not deferred answers its source after its passes, as before: basket A takes the
# apple at once
drag #101 356,114
expect text:"Ende: Apfel verschieben (4)" exists
drop expect move
# a new drag while the answer waits overtakes it: the pear's drop is answered as delivered (it
# ends, moved), the cherry's drag runs; the late drop_finish of "Später" finds no drop waiting
drag #102 640,330
expect text:"Antwort: wartet" exists
drag #103 82,229
expect text:"Text: Kirsche" exists
expect text:"Ende: Kirsche verschieben (6)" exists
wait 150
expect text:"Antwort: zu spät" exists
expect text:"Quelle: -" exists
expect_nowarn
